<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>奇怪的事情：韦伯对负担能力议程的愿景（播客）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/audio/2026-11-27/odd-lots-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda-podcast</link><description>目前政治上最重要的词是负担能力。这是民主党在中期选举中获胜的一个议题，也是欧洲各地人们走上街头抗议的原因之一：食品、住房和能源日益昂贵。在大流行最严重的时期，我们与伊莎贝拉·韦伯讨论了很多关于通货膨胀的问题，她关于政府可以采取哪些措施来让人们的生活变得更加负担得起的问题已经演变成了一本名为《反法西斯经济学：捍卫负担能力》的书&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/audio/2026-11-27/odd-lots-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda-podcast'&gt;奇怪的事情：韦伯对负担能力议程的愿景（播客）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Odd Lots: Weber’s Vision for an Affordability Agenda (Podcast)&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/audio/2026-11-27/odd-lots-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda-podcast</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>伊莎贝拉·韦伯的负担能力议程愿景</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/isabella-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda</link><description>与《反法西斯经济学》作者的对话。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/isabella-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda'&gt;伊莎贝拉·韦伯的负担能力议程愿景&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Isabella Weber’s Vision for an Affordability Agenda&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/isabella-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:00:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>法院裁决后，Bawag 的 16 亿欧元 PTSB 交易存在不确定性</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/irish-high-court-refuses-to-approve-bawag-s-ptsb-deal</link><description>当爱尔兰法院裁定奥地利银行未满足所有程序要求时，Bawag Group AG 计划以 16 亿欧元（18 亿美元）收购 Permanent TSB Group Holdings Plc 的计划陷入不确定性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/irish-high-court-refuses-to-approve-bawag-s-ptsb-deal'&gt;法院裁决后，Bawag 的 16 亿欧元 PTSB 交易存在不确定性&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bawag’s €1.6 Billion PTSB Deal Uncertain After Court Ruling&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/irish-high-court-refuses-to-approve-bawag-s-ptsb-deal</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:09:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Futures Rally as Tech Rebound Gains Momentum: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>